Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.22,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,There's a bit of blood on the arrowhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:50.80,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kamo-san's technique must be why \Ntheir paths can ignore physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:55.87,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,You can call more than one type \Nof shikigami at a time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.82,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Can't say I appreciate \Nyou holding out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:03.46,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,My Demon Dog's busy with its task.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What about you? You're on \Nyour last arrow, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:09.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,No one's helping you if \Nyou pass out from anemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.29,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Blood Manipulation:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.48,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,a technique that manipulates one's \Nblood and objects imbued with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:19.46,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,fitting for one of the three major clans \Nand their love of bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.12,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:25.52,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,These are all arrows \NI prepared ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:28.21,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Ten Shadows Technique:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.25,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,one of the Zenin clan's \Nhereditary techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.46,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,It creates ten types of shikigami \Nusing shadows as its medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.31,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,If only Maki or Mai had \Ninherited that technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:52.27,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He has that much power?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:56.45,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Nice reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.04,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,But stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:08.66,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I was too slow to defend with cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:12.26,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,With this much speed and power, \Nit's like he's a different person now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:18.64,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Manipulating blood isn't limited \Nto its shape and motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.89,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Body temperature, pulse,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:24.70,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,red blood cells, and all \Nother components of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:26.26,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,are mine to freely control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.67,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Flowing Red Scale!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.08,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You're doping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:33.66,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Very astute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:36.69,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,But I wish you wouldn't use\Nsuch a layman's term for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:01.84,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1398,1)\c&H0F0D09&\3c&HB7BD80&\t(1236,1817,1 \3c&H85A2A4&)\t(1819,2945,1 \3c&H95DED9&)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
